Pencil beam through void, exact geometry only in the input
c Companion of pencil_beam.mcnp (same ray, same void world): every voxel
c scores exactly chord_length / voxel_volume. Here the meshes are what the
c meshtal header can't describe: TR= placements (TRn cosines, *TRn degrees
c with m=-1, a 6-value TRn), unround origins and axes, bins finer than the
c 0.01 cm the header prints, and unround energy/time bins. Only the FMESH
c cards of this input give their geometry exactly; see
c crates/meshtal-core/tests/pencil_beam_input.rs.
c Regenerate with: mcnp6 i=pencil_beam_input.mcnp n=pbi.
1 0 -1 imp:n=1
2 0  1 imp:n=0

1 SO 200

MODE N
SDEF POS=-56.3597402157 -26.9768830971 -30.9828571187
     VEC=0.8151391459 0.3668126157 0.4483265303 DIR=1 ERG=14 TME=0
NPS 100
PRDMP 2j 1
TR1 2.71828 -1.41421 1.73205
     0.813018687901 0.511291847175 -0.278534127417 -0.453759135760 0.856168221462 0.247140897612
     0.364833194540 -0.074542763367 0.928084110731
*TR2 3.250000000000 -1.750000000000 2.500000000000
     29.541623354159 90.777530758189 119.529323566850 113.730627233425 56.082934043478 136.529888204004
     73.449201820497 33.928457823950 61.315188914591 -1
TR3 -1.5 0.75 -2.25 -0.488249582426 -0.849160427513 -0.201342776393
     0.670570477622 -0.217388158425 -0.709279650856
TR4 1.1 -0.7 0.4
     0.813018687901 0.511291847175 -0.278534127417 -0.453759135760 0.856168221462 0.247140897612
     -0.364833194540 0.074542763367 -0.928084110731
TR5 0.5 -0.25 1 0.48 0.6 0.64
TR6 -0.3 0.2 0.1 0.81 0.51 -0.28 -0.45 0.86 0.25 0.36 -0.07 0.93
FC2004 rect, TR1 (cosines), sub-0.01 cm bins, shortcuts, out=cf
FMESH2004:N ORIGIN -12.3456 -11.1111 -13.0707
        IMESH -3.001 -3 2I 12.777 IINTS 1 1 2R 5
        JMESH 0.0042 13.3333 JINTS 2 3
        KMESH -5.5555 14.1414 KINTS 2 3
        TR=1 OUT=CF
FC2014 rect, *TR2 (degrees, m=-1), out=ik
FMESH2014:N ORIGIN -12.3456 -11.1111 -13.0707
        IMESH -3.001 -3 12.777 IINTS 1 1 5
        JMESH 0.0042 13.3333 JINTS 2 3
        KMESH -5.5555 14.1414 KINTS 2 3
        TR 2 OUT=IK
FC2024 rect, TR3 (two columns given), col
FMESH2024:N ORIGIN -12.3456 -11.1111 -13.0707
        IMESH -3.001 -3 12.777 IINTS 1 1 5
        JMESH 0.0042 13.3333 JINTS 2 3
        KMESH -5.5555 14.1414 KINTS 2 3
        TR=3
FC2034 cyl, TR1, unround origin/AXS/VEC, out=cf
FMESH2034:N GEOM=CYL ORIGIN 1.23456 -0.67891 -12.34567
        AXS 0.61234 0.01234 0.79012 VEC 1.41421 0.11111 0.22222
        IMESH 2.0005 6.54321 14.4444 IINTS 2 3 2
        JMESH 7.0707 26.2626 JINTS 2 5
        KMESH 0.1234 0.35791 1 KINTS 1 2 2
        TR=1 OUT=CF
FC2044 cyl, unround, no TR, out=jk
FMESH2044:N GEOM=RZT ORIGIN 1.23456 -0.67891 -12.34567
        AXS 0.61234 0.01234 0.79012 VEC 1.41421 0.11111 0.22222
        IMESH 2.0005 6.54321 14.4444 IINTS 2 3 2
        JMESH 7.0707 26.2626 JINTS 2 5
        KMESH 0.1234 0.35791 1 KINTS 1 2 2
        OUT=JK
FC2054 rect, TR3, unround EMESH/TMESH with fine bins, out=ij
FMESH2054:N ORIGIN -12.3456 -11.1111 -13.0707
        IMESH 12.777 IINTS 3
        JMESH 13.3333 JINTS 2
        KMESH 14.1414 KINTS 3
        EMESH 1.23456 13.98765 20.2468 EINTS 2 3 1
        TMESH 0.123456 7.7777 TINTS 1 2
        TR=3 OUT=IJ
FC2064 energy-weighted *FMESH, cyl with *TR2
*FMESH2064:N GEOM=CYL ORIGIN -1.11 2.22 -15.55
        IMESH 13.131 IINTS 3 JMESH 30.303 JINTS 3 KMESH 1 KINTS 4
        TR=2
FC2074 rect, TR4 (a reflection)
FMESH2074:N ORIGIN -12.3456 -11.1111 -13.0707
        IMESH -3.001 -3 12.777 IINTS 1 1 5
        JMESH 0.0042 13.3333 JINTS 2 3
        KMESH -5.5555 14.1414 KINTS 2 3
        TR=4
FC2084 rect, TR5 (one vector: MCNP completes the frame)
FMESH2084:N ORIGIN -12.3456 -11.1111 -13.0707
        IMESH -3.001 -3 12.777 IINTS 1 1 5
        JMESH 0.0042 13.3333 JINTS 2 3
        KMESH -5.5555 14.1414 KINTS 2 3
        TR=5
FC2094 rect, TR6 (cosines to two decimals, renormalized)
FMESH2094:N ORIGIN -12.3456 -11.1111 -13.0707
        IMESH -3.001 -3 12.777 IINTS 1 1 5
        JMESH 0.0042 13.3333 JINTS 2 3
        KMESH -5.5555 14.1414 KINTS 2 3
        TR=6
FC2104 cyl, TR4: a mirrored cylinder, which aci_mesh can't describe
FMESH2104:N GEOM=CYL ORIGIN 1.23456 -0.67891 -12.34567
        AXS 0.61234 0.01234 0.79012 VEC 1.41421 0.11111 0.22222
        IMESH 2.0005 6.54321 14.4444 IINTS 2 3 2
        JMESH 7.0707 26.2626 JINTS 2 5
        KMESH 0.1234 0.35791 1 KINTS 1 2 2
        TR=4
